        gradient: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #065f46, #059669)',
        initial: 'WI',
        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/400/574/avatar/1776729651-wildflower-logos_avatar-northeast.jpg",
        google: { rating: 4.5, review_count: 64, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=11438091904175603222&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Leah Schultheis', rating: 5, text: 'I cannot recommend this store enough! From the moment I walked in, I knew I was in for a premium experience. The atmosphere is calming, clean, and modern—none of that "sketchy" vibe you get elsewhere. It felt more like a high-end boutique than a typical shop. The Staff (Knowledgeable & Friendly): Shoutout to Carrie, who was not only incredibly friendly but clearly an expert. They took the time to ', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Marigold Santiago-Merced', rating: 5, text: 'Honestly so happy to finally have not one but two high quality dispensaries here in Minnesota. My parents made it there before I did! I was a little disappointed that they were out of the preroll I wanted but I\'ll take it as a good sign that it\'s gaining traction. But what made me really happy was Grace and her incredible knowledge and care. You can tell how passionate she is about cannabis educat', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Breanna Barr', rating: 5, text: 'The staff is so friendly and helpful! They were able to answer my questions confidently and help me make my choices. And the space is warm and inviting! Will definitely be coming back soon!', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'The best is yet to come', rating: 1, text: 'They forgot to give me my discount. The yellow bright haired female was awesome. The long honey haired female refused to look me in my eye  when she said hello, and goodbye. She was the one who basically said  too bad for you! She/They were super unapologetic and funky about not giving me my discount. Every thing is extremely over priced so the discount would have helped a lot. The fact that they ', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Erin Kaine', rating: 5, text: 'Woop woop! We love a dispensary in the city with a parking lot &&&&& finally has flower for sale 💚🌱🙌🏼  Updates: love the Grapes N Cream! Great gassy hybrid that burns super clean. That’s what we like to see 👏🏼👏🏼', time: '6 months ago'}] }
