        google: { rating: 3.1, review_count: 15, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=2004734870712305244&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Jamie', rating: 1, text: 'I bought 2 sets of pre rolls here. Both were supposed to be the same weight. Here\'s the side by side comparison.  Both joints in one were significantly smaller and weigh less too. Didnt thi k id have to check my scale when buying from a store. Thats some b.s. for ya right there.', time: 'in the last week'}, {author: 'Lj M', rating: 3, text: 'It does not bring me joy to share this experience, but at the same time, I\'m hoping it\'s understood it comes with the best of intentions to see your store improve.  The person reviewing IDs is legit. Nice guy.  Interactions with bud tenders felt "forced" and the knowledge of selling/educating customers were entry level. Questions were yes/no, limited interest in promoting and reading customer vibe', time: 'a week ago'}, {author: 'Jed Divine', rating: 1, text: 'Prices are atrocious! With the money you can save driving to St. Cloud instead of Alexandria you get nearly double the amount of product if not more than double every time.', time: '2 weeks ago'}, {author: 'Phil T', rating: 5, text: 'Great customer service those guys are awesome. The selection is also top notch', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Cory Springer', rating: 5, text: 'Great service. Not much of a selection yet, but it\'s nice to finally be able to buy some high-quality bud locally. The prices are high as expected, but they\'ll come down just like in every other State that legalized marijuana.  The only drawback was that they didn\'t have any Bubba Kush in stock, which is what I\'ve found to be the best medicine for my multiple sclerosis. I\'ll just have to continue ', time: 'a month ago'}] }
