        img: null,
        google: { rating: 4.4, review_count: 409, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=16575895052456821740&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Sandi Mullen', rating: 5, text: 'Was my first visit, it was very welcoming, friendly atmosphere, the knowledge of the employees were amazing. I ordered Black Maple flower and Flat Jacks flower  both hands down. The relaxation was awesome and I slept like a baby which was also awesome. Will definitely be back', time: '8 months ago'}, {author: 'Waddles', rating: 5, text: 'I’ve tried RISE twice now for adult use and both times were very disappointing, the flower was extremely dry with low potency. Tried Green Goods for the first time yesterday and was impressed by the improvement in product. Nice buds with a fantastic high. I ordered ahead online and didn’t have to wait long for pick up. The employee helping us out was very friendly. Will definitely be back!', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Kristin Almquist', rating: 5, text: 'I pretty much use the store exclusively. There’s something really special about going into a business these days and having people know your name and smile at you. The staff is amazing! I appreciate you all so much.', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Sheriff Brauer', rating: 5, text: 'Such an an absolutely amazing establishment. Medical canibus ,amazing selection,  reasonable prices . Knowledgeable staff and employees. Pharmacists, and team members, Who care about helping the patient. Highly recommended as one of the finest dispensaries around . As I build this review weekly watch it grow .', time: '11 months ago'}, {author: 'Michael Cooper', rating: 4, text: 'The staff are friendly, as a medical patient most of the staff recognizes me as soon as I walk in. I\'ve  always received everything I order. I give feed back on products I\'ve tried and the bud tender has not. I definitely recommend this location. Update: 1/3/2026 They could use work especially with parking for disabled medical patients. Their  knowledge  of what products they have on hand and when', time: '3 months ago'}] }
