        initial: 'GG',
        img: null,
        google: { rating: 4.7, review_count: 400, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=18251015212855456438&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Rogue Obst (RogueRat)', rating: 5, text: 'Top tier product and service, best in hermantown for stock updates on website and services in store, I have never left a store happier. Staff is very friendly and smile at each person creating a relaxing environment,as well as being helpful and kind. Highly suggest for beginners and old-timers alike.', time: '7 months ago'}, {author: 'Casey Mattson.', rating: 5, text: 'Love this place the staff is amazing and they are so knowledgeable. Always quick and easy to get in to and out. The store is so nice and clean', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Jessi Johnson', rating: 5, text: 'Staff is super friendly, checkout was fast and easy. This maybe my favorite location, definitely coming back!!', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Dr Doom', rating: 3, text: 'I\'ve made a few purchases here. The store is decent and the staff is friendly. The prices are much too expensive though. The THC in the flower they offer is usually low also. I started driving to Cloquet for purchases, because I get double what my money\'s worth. Bottom line, the product here is way overpriced. I can get an OZ in Cloquet, for the price of a half OZ at this store. It\'s worth the dri', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Lisa Lee', rating: 5, text: 'Green Goods is the only medical cannabis supplier in our area and now also serves adults over 21.  The two markets are separate.  The staff is friendly and there is online staff to help you decide what you want/need.   The hours and days are very accessible.   The parking lot could be more accessible with only one handicap spot, the ramp pretty far from the door, and a very heavy door to enter the', time: '5 months ago'}] }
